<title>CHILE: TENNIS-GUMY BEATS RIOS IN HELLMAN'S CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GUMY BEATS RIOS IN HELLMAN'S CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result from the Hellman's Cup</p>
<p>ATP men's tennis tournament Sunday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>4-Hernan Gumy (Argentina) beat 1-Marcelo Rios (Chile) 6-4 7-5</p>
